{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08390","headline":"江上寄元六林宗 · 李白","name":"江上寄元六林宗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜落江始寒，枫叶绿未脱。\n客行悲清秋，永路苦不达。\n沧波眇川汜，白日隐天末。\n停櫂依林峦，惊猿相呌聒。\n夜分河汉转，起视溟涨阔。\n凉风何萧萧，流水鸣活活。\n浦沙净如洗，海月明可掇。\n兰交空怀思，琼树讵解渴。\n勖哉沧洲心，岁晚庶不夺。\n幽赏颇自得，兴远与谁豁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}